// world_X3.zag -- falsification: first-match pattern
// selection. Two live patterns: mP1' id3 (nf=3,
// f11-f18) and mP2' id4 (nf=2, f19-f24). QX3 region
// f25-f31 (90->96, 2 folds) fits mP2' but the search
// commits to mP1'. 32 facts. mA' here has nf=3
// (f1-f8, 20->27) so SUBSTITUTE cannot span the
// 2-fold region either.

